    Takes inputs: {'year': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Fiscal year of interest (e.g. ``2009``).'}}
    Returns an output of type: object
- list_expense_category_names_tool: List every expense category available in the database.
    Takes inputs: {}
    Returns an output of type: array
- get_category_id_by_name_tool: Translate a category name to its internal identifier.
    Takes inputs: {'category_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Exact category name (case-sensitive).'}}
    Returns an output of type: integer
- get_line_item_amount_tool: Return the amount (in millions USD) for a (report, category) pair.
    Takes inputs: {'report_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Internal identifier from ``financial_reports`` table.'}, 'category_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Internal identifier from ``expense_categories`` table.'}}
    Returns an output of type: integer
- list_all_line_items_for_year_tool: Return every (category, amount) pair for the specified fiscal year.
    Takes inputs: {'year': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Fiscal year whose line-items you wish to inspect.'}}
    Returns an output of type: array
